featured.description:
New #ePrivacy Draft (#Portugal) is out.

Portugal’s draft largely follows the structure adopted by the preceding German Presidency.

Portugal’s substantive amendments to the draft regulation propose to “simplify the text and to further align it with the #GDPR,” and further “reflect the lex specialis relation of ePrivacy to the GDPR.” 

Some noteworthy amendments include:

Widening the territorial scope of the draft regulation so that it also applies to the processing of personal data by a controller not established in the EEA;

Adding the definition of “location data” to the draft regulation.

Reinserting provisions that authorize the processing of electr. comm. data (including metadata) for purposes compatible with the initial purpose for which the data was collected; 

Inserting the GDPR standard of processing for the “performance of a contract”; According to the draft, the previous version included a “too restrictive lawful basis”

Requiring service providers sharing anonymized statistical electronic communications data with 3rd parties to carry out a #DPIA and inform end-users of the envisaged processing operations; 

Authorizing service providers to access data on the end-users’ devices where necessary for the performance of a contract; The word “technically” was deleted.

education.description:
Cette formation permet :
1. d'intervenir en tant qu’enseignant ou formateur en langue ;
2. d'assurer la coordination pédagogique d'un centre de langues ;
3. de concevoir, analyser, réorienter, évaluer et mettre en oeuvre des projets d'ingénierie de formation de différents formats (présentiel, à distance, hybride);
4. de définir des formes d’intervention pour la diffusion des langues quel que soit le cadre (institutionnel ou marché des langues) en s'appuyant sur la conduite d'analyses politiques, sociolinguistiques, anthropologiques et culturelles des situations éducatives concernées ; de mener des audits ; d'élaborer des formations professionnelles destinées aux personnels enseignants ; d'élaborer des dispositifs d’évaluation de formation linguistique et des plans de formation.

